Example 1:
Input: @words = ("cat", "cats", "dog", "dogcat", "dogcat", "rat", "ratcatdogcat")
Output: ("cat", "dog", "dogcat", "rat")

Example 2:
Input: @words = ("hello", "hell", "world", "wor", "ellow", "elloworld")
